  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Workshop - Talking with poor people about a post 2015 framework</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A two-day workshop that brings together to enable dialogue between three constituencies: those who already have activities in development to engage with poor-people about post-2015; those who have expertise in large-scale exercises in participatory engagement; and agencies who might consider providing funding (including DFID) to a larger scale global exercise.</narrative>
  </description>
